<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Calling</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background: #ffffff;
      font-family: Arial, "Noto Sans KR", sans-serif;
    }

    .container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 420px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .call-button {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px;
      background: #111;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .number {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: #333;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">
    <h1>Calling</h1>

    <p>
      전화 상담을 원하시면<br>
      아래 버튼을 눌러주세요.
    </p>

    <a class="call-button" href="tel:02-322-1187">
      📞 전화 상담하기
    </a>

    <div class="number">
      02-322-1187
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
